"identifiers":{},"description":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Stephen E. Ambrose, destacado cronista de la Segunda Guerra Mundial, nos narra en esta novela la historia de la compañía E del 506 regimiento de la 101 división aerotransportada a lo largo de la última contienda mundial. Siguiendo a sus miembros desde Normandía hasta el asalto al nido del águila de Hitler, pasando por la operación Market-Garden en Holanda, o la terrible batalla de las Ardenas. Con un estilo que mezcla la crónica periodística con la narración histórica, narración fiel basada en los testimonios de los supervivientes, Ambrose nos describe unas escenas bélicas impactantes y excelentemente narradas que nos meten en el centro de la acción así como a unos hombres jóvenes inmersos en el caos de la guerra a los que vamos a ir conociendo a lo largo de la obra."},"contributors":[{"role":"Translator","name":"Gerardo Di Masso"}],"covers":[10178991],"physical_format":"Paperback","key":"/books/OL28248856M","publish_places":["Barcelona, Spain"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/spa"}],"classifications":{},"title":"Hermanos de sangre","translation_of":"Band of brothers","notes":"Includes illustrations and maps.\r\nFirst edition in this collection.","number_of_pages":505,"isbn_13":["9788492400379"],"edition_name":"1st ed.","isbn_10":["8492400374"],"publish_date":"2008","oclc_numbers":["804160558"],"works":[{"key":"/works/OL478550W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"physical_dimensions":"19 x  x  centimeters","latest_revision":5,"revision":5,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2020-06-13T12:13:37.002124"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2021-10-20T22:10:42.946603"}},{"identifiers":{"goodreads":["45542"],"librarything":["1566770"]},"title":"Frýýres d'Armes: Compagnie E, 506e Regiment, 101e Airborne","subtitle":"Du Debarquement en Normandie au Nid d'Aigle d'Hitler (Band of Brothers in French)","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL29987A"}],"publish_date":"May 16, 2002","publishers":["Albin Michel"],"contributions":["Alain Deschamps (Translator)"],"isbn_13":["9782226127099"],"covers":[3101053],"physical_format":"Paperback","isbn_10":["2226127097"],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"ocaid":"frresdarmescompa0000step","source_records":["amazon:2226127097"],"key":"/books/OL12463208M","number_of_pages":366,"works":[{"key":"/works/OL478550W"}],"latest_revision":9,"revision":9,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2008-04-30T20:50:18.033121"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2026-01-31T16:34:58.275711"}},{"notes":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Chivers Sound Library"},"identifiers":{"goodreads":["6006252"],"librarything":["1566770"]},"title":"Band of Brothers","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL29987A"}],"publish_date":"November 2001","publishers":["Sound Library"],"weight":"1.1 pounds","physical_format":"Audio CD","contributions":["Tim Jerome (Narrator)"],"subjects":["History","Abridged Audio - Fiction/Suspense Thriller","Audio Adult: Books On Tape","Military - World War II"],"edition_name":"Unabridged edition","languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"isbn_13":["9780792799320"],"isbn_10":["0792799321"],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"physical_dimensions":"7.5 x 7.2 x 1.6 inches","source_records":["amazon:0792799321"],"key":"/books/OL7812068M","number_of_pages":13,"works":[{"key":"/works/OL478550W"}],"latest_revision":7,"revision":7,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2008-04-29T15:03:11.581851"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2026-01-12T01:07:13.357114"}}]}